      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "## Bevy version and features\n\n- 0.18.0-rc.2 but appears to have been in the first RC as well\n\n## What you did\n\nAttempting to bump [LWIM](https://github.com/Leafwing-Studios/leafwing-input-manager/) to the 0.18.0-rc.\n\n## What went wrong\n\nI noticed that [cargo_features.md](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/main/docs/cargo_features.md) claims that `bevy_gilrs` adds `gamepad` which does not appear to be the case per the [Cargo.toml](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/98a5aa50c3f0ba3af72920b994387790230f43d9/Cargo.toml#L313)\n\nI'm more than happy to fix it myself but I need guidance on whether we should have:\na) the feature be added by `bevy_gilrs` per the documents < I lean toward this option\nb) the document be updated to not make this claim\nc) something else entirely",
